  "body": "Commanding what may well be some of Auckland's most spectacular harbour and city views, this remarkable sub-penthouse offers a level of luxury and exclusivity rarely found in apartment living on the North Shore.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you enter, the breathtaking panorama unfolds before you. Sweeping across more than 180 degrees, the ever-changing outlook encompasses the ever-changing activity of Waitemata Harbour, Auckland Bridge, city skyline and beyond to the Eastern Bays.\r\n\r\nBeautifully remodelled and renovated with a sophisticated international aesthetic, the apartment combines generous proportions, premium craftsmanship and exceptional attention to detail. Spacious open-plan living areas, complemented by polished timber flooring and seamless indoor-outdoor flow, create an elegant setting for both relaxed living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe stunning designer kitchen by Shelly Ferguson is appointed with a full suite of premium Miele appliances, including a coffee machine, steam oven and microwave, it also features stone benchtops, integrated full-height refrigeration and ducted ventilation, ensuring style and functionality are perfectly balanced.\r\n\r\nThe luxurious master suite provides a private sanctuary, complete with generous wardrobe space, tiled ensuite with underfloor heating, and access to a sunny north-facing deck which enjoys all day sun and magnificent sunsets.\r\n\r\nEvery aspect of the apartment reflects quality and comfort, from bespoke joinery and abundant storage to heat pumps, a separate laundry and thoughtfully designed accommodation.\r\n\r\nAdding further appeal are approximately one-and-a-half covered garaging spaces, beautifully maintained grounds, a resort-style inground swimming pool, and private access via a waterfront path to the residents' jetty. These exceptional amenities create a unique lifestyle rarely available in apartment living.\r\n\r\nPositioned within one of Devonport's most exclusive residential peninsulas, this prestigious address offers the perfect balance of tranquility and connectivity. The vibrant Devonport village, boutique shopping, cafés, beaches and waterfront are close at hand, while the Auckland CBD is just a short ferry journey away. With ferry services approximately every 30 minutes and bus transportation from your gate to the ferry, commuting to the city is effortless.\r\n\r\nThea spectacular views offer an interesting and beautiful backdrop for your life, exceptional quality and an unparalleled lifestyle setting, this is one of the North Shore’s finest apartment residences and a truly rare opportunity for a wonderful easy-care home or the ultimate lock-up and leave.",
